172
00:13:57,072 --> 00:14:03,111
enter them in the reading box and press Check. Then compare with 0.8.

173
00:14:03,511 --> 00:14:10,770
Task two. Press Scramble timing, which imitates a badly adjusted machine.

174
00:14:11,170 --> 00:14:17,590
First use the feed-timing slider to line up the drop with the moment the top

175
00:14:17,610 --> 00:14:20,047
of the eye reaches the plate,

176
00:14:20,447 --> 00:14:25,616
then remove back-drag with the phase difference.

177
00:14:25,636 --> 00:14:29,507
It's done when every reading passes.

178
00:14:29,907 --> 00:14:30,754
Task three.

179
00:14:30,774 --> 00:14:36,743
Switch to four plies of denim and advance the feed timing until the movement

180
00:14:36,763 --> 00:14:40,447
