181
00:14:40,847 --> 00:14:43,837
Task four. Two plies of slippery lining.

182
00:14:43,857 --> 00:14:49,329
Raise the foot pressure step by step and watch slipping and shift change.

183
00:14:49,349 --> 00:14:53,015
