213
00:17:03,766 --> 00:17:05,346
Three things to remember.

214
00:17:05,746 --> 00:17:11,883
One: the dog's motion combines two harmonic motions into a tilted ellipse,

215
00:17:11,903 --> 00:17:16,126
and only the part above the plate pushes the cloth.

216
00:17:16,526 --> 00:17:21,627
Two: the cloth may move only after the needle is out;

217
00:17:21,647 --> 00:17:27,328
standard timing has the dog face and eye top sink together,

218
00:17:27,348 --> 00:17:31,386
and heavy cloth needs the timing advanced.

219
00:17:31,786 --> 00:17:38,446
Three: drop feed is caught between slipping and ply shift, and needle,

220
00:17:38,466 --> 00:17:41,882
compound and top feed each solve it.

